dding-bottom--variant="20px" class="padding-bottom w-variant-4bf34408-5713-4198-ea75-ffee00e40648"></div><div class="background-box"><div class="background-grid"><div class="grey-box on-left"><div class="white-box"></div><div class="grey-line"></div></div><div class="grey-box"><div class="white-box"><div class="background"></div></div></div><div class="grey-box on-right"><div class="white-box"></div><div class="grey-line is-second"></div></div></div></div></section><section data-wf--section--variant="base" class="section"><div data-wf--padding-top--variant="80px" class="padding-top w-variant-202638a9-042c-bea3-ef96-d2c553e66cdd"></div><div class="container"><div data-aos="fade-in" data-wf--layout--variant="stacked" class="layout"><div class="slot-1"><div mobile-align-center="" data-max-width="754" data-align-content="center" data-wf--content--variant="spacing---24px" class="content"><div class="box w-variant-99769a71-6384-d033-cbe1-86f114679d2b"><h2 data-wf--heading--variant="48px---h2" class="heading w-variant-5699317a-0f5f-cf07-180b-6b2039a0b8fb">The Best Investors Use Artemis</h2><div mobile-align-center="" data-max-width="420" data-align-content="center" data-wf--content--variant="spacing---none" class="content"><div class="box"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular-muted---16px">Analysts, PMs and independent analysts on how they build conviction with Artemis Analyst.</p></div><div class="w-embed"><style>
  [data-max-width="420"] {max-width: 420px;}
</style></div></div></div><div class="w-embed"><style>
  [data-max-width="754"] {max-width: 754px;}
</style></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_8319fe73-1458-0dab-b346-e3be69716e3d-4dea52f6" class="slot-2"><div class="testimonial-slider"><div id="testimonials" class="swiper is-testimonials w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="swiper-wrapper w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Artemis Analyst is my favorite</div><div class="link-icon"><div class="svg-icon w-embed"><svg width="0.75em" height="0.75em" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.37521 3V7.875C9.37521 7.97446 9.3357 8.06984 9.26537 8.14017C9.19505 8.21049 9.09967 8.25 9.00021 8.25C8.90075 8.25 8.80537 8.21049 8.73504 8.14017C8.66472 8.06984 8.62521 7.97446 8.62521 7.875V3.90516L3.26552 9.26531C3.19516 9.33568 3.09972 9.37521 3.00021 9.37521C2.9007 9.37521 2.80526 9.33568 2.7349 9.26531C2.66453 9.19495 2.625 9.09951 2.625 9C2.625 8.90049 2.66453 8.80505 2.7349 8.73469L8.09505 3.375H4.12521C4.02575 3.375 3.93037 3.33549 3.86004 3.26517C3.78972 3.19484 3.75021 3.09946 3.75021 3C3.75021 2.90054 3.78972 2.80516 3.86004 2.73484C3.93037 2.66451 4.02575 2.625 4.12521 2.625H9.00021C9.09967 2.625 9.19505 2.66451 9.26537 2.73484C9.3357 2.80516 9.37521 2.90054 9.37521 3Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis Analyst is easily one of my favorite tools. The ability to consult an LLM that is connected to a large database and have it provide near-real-time analytics is extremely time-efficient. Something as involved as building a model from historical on-chain data can now be generated, evaluated, and refined much more quickly than it could have been in the past.
</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a91d4d26cb16e84dc2ae4f1_1786497152127.jpeg" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">David Kroeger</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Director of Digital Assets Research</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div><a href="https://about.artemis.ai/resources/analyst-of-the-month-david-kroger" target="_blank" class="slide-link w-inline-block"></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">One-of-a-kind tool</div><div class="link-icon"><div class="svg-icon w-embed"><svg width="0.75em" height="0.75em" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.37521 3V7.875C9.37521 7.97446 9.3357 8.06984 9.26537 8.14017C9.19505 8.21049 9.09967 8.25 9.00021 8.25C8.90075 8.25 8.80537 8.21049 8.73504 8.14017C8.66472 8.06984 8.62521 7.97446 8.62521 7.875V3.90516L3.26552 9.26531C3.19516 9.33568 3.09972 9.37521 3.00021 9.37521C2.9007 9.37521 2.80526 9.33568 2.7349 9.26531C2.66453 9.19495 2.625 9.09951 2.625 9C2.625 8.90049 2.66453 8.80505 2.7349 8.73469L8.09505 3.375H4.12521C4.02575 3.375 3.93037 3.33549 3.86004 3.26517C3.78972 3.19484 3.75021 3.09946 3.75021 3C3.75021 2.90054 3.78972 2.80516 3.86004 2.73484C3.93037 2.66451 4.02575 2.625 4.12521 2.625H9.00021C9.09967 2.625 9.19505 2.66451 9.26537 2.73484C9.3357 2.80516 9.37521 2.90054 9.37521 3Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><p class="quote-text">Shoutout to @artemis&#x27; Analyst for help with charts + modeling. One-of-a-kind tool.</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a849f162f333ef165954985_crLS6lV1.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Camran Khosravi</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Research Analyst @Bitwise</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div><a href="https://x.com/CamKhosravi/status/2089432935585714416?s=20" target="_blank" class="slide-link w-inline-block"></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Analyst, Analyst, Analyst</div></div><p class="quote-text">I’ve really enjoyed using the Analyst feature, especially as this has evolved, to create charts and pull quotes from recent interviews and earnings calls. </p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74b8ebfd53e8e0718ebf02_kXvwFDH6_400x400.jpg" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Crossroads</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Independent Analyst</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Go to platform for research</div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis remains my go-to platform for research, given the breadth of protocol coverage in addition to their variety of data points + charts.
</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74d5428c991ed880b21e0e_jono_lee.webp" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Jono Lee</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Associate at ParFi</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Jaw Dropping Experience</div></div><p class="quote-text">After decades of investing, I finally have my dream product. I used to spend countless hours sifting through filings, documents and podcasts - but now its all at my fingertips with Artemis Analyst.</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74b90ee0caa3f9fffd8726_1683566339358.jpeg" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Andrew Van Aken</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Data Science Lead</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">AN INDISPENSABLE TOOL</div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis is an indispensable tool in my research process. I live in Excel, and having an Artemis plug-in that can pull in prices and fundamental data series in a similar fashion as the Bloomberg plug-in is incredible.</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a64263bd20b67c05fb371b7_cosmo-jiang.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Cosmo Jiang </p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Portfolio Manager at Pantera Capital</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">I use Artemis daily</div></div><p class="quote-text">“It helps me inform my Alpha generating research as well as my explanatory or pieces I write for curious investors&quot;.</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a642559bd9b2222e36ff180_patrick-bush.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Patrick Bush</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Senior Digital Analyst at VanEck</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Comprehensive Data</div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis has some of the most comprehensive data in the industry when it comes to doing fundamental research. Data analysis is an essential part of my process. In fact, I’m currently working on a new research piece I’ll share in the coming weeks that is anchored by Artemis data. I think it will show some trends no one has visualized before.</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a6424ca33164a9b6a8f328c_ryan.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Ryan Watkins</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Syncracy Capital</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Stablecoin Data</div></div><p class="quote-text">Nobody is pushing forward our understanding of stablecoins through data the way Artemis is. The by region information (and some more granular data they have underneath) is going to become essential for any payment business utilizing on chain workflows</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a64248f87226e246243c189_RNIvWJbg_400x400.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Rob Hadick</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Dragonfly</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">High Quality Data</div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis is quite literally my knight in shining armor. Being able to pull all relevant protocol metrics across a variety of ecosystems allows us to better discern comparable performance between products, patterns across sectors or ecosystems, and hidden insights often obscured by the challenge of extracting high quality data from block explorers. Bonus points for directly plugging into Excel!!</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a6423fb2d2279d5e38939a1_paul-codjoe.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Paul Codjoe</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Research Analyst at Franklin Templeton</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Valuable for Fundamental Research</div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis has proven to be a valuable tool for my fundamental research. I find the Excel plug-in very useful because it allows me to pull in multiple data sources into Excel without having to go to each of these sources’ websites for the data. Generally, it’s one of the tools I use day-to-day, and I am impressed by the team and constant improvement of the platform.</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a6422d2adb4c1ef822cc71e_david-alderman.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">David Alderman</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Research Analyst at Franklin Templeton</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Center of Daily Workflow</div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis is the center of our daily workflow; we automate spreadsheets to track relevant metrics for verticals that we cover using the Artemis API; and also directly look at the Artemis dashboard to find out fundamental metrics across blockchains and specific categories such as perpetual exchanges and lending and borrowing market. I also like how the Artemis team has been responsive to feedback and comments from us; and the way they keep shipping new features from time to time - huge fan of Artemis and I would suggest Artemis to all liquid crypto investors out there!</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a64220b5acf1e4ef49c2a43_cody.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Cody Poh</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Investment Analyst at Pantera Capital</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Integral to Investing</div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis is integral to our investment process. We use Artemis Sheets on a daily basis for all our excel-based workflow, whether that involves updating fundamental metrics (TVL, volume, revenue) or prices. We use Artemis Dashboards to dive deeper into fundamental data across L1/L2 ecosystems, and category specific applications (perpetuals).Some of the more recent products like Blockchain Activity Monitor (BAM) help us identify new and upcoming protocols that are seeing an inflection in usage, and the latest Chart Builder allows us to easily visualize and compare protocols in an easy, no code way.We are huge fans of the Artemis product and team!</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a6421c26c56029a5963a792_james%20(1).avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">James Ho and Vincent Jow</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Co-Founders of Modular Capital</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slide-wrap"><div class="slide-card"><div class="border"><div class="slide-content"><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="grid is-auto"><div class="small-text is-medium is-uppercase">Tool I use Most</div></div><p class="quote-text">Artemis is the tool I use the most. Go and look at my 50+ articles published in the last year. Artemis is the most widely sourced. Artemis is my go to for pulling on chain data and easily comparing metrics across protocols. I also use it to build dashboards and models in Excel and Google Sheets that update with a click of a button. Check out the Ethereum template I built on Artemis sample templates.</p></div><div class="box has-16-gap"><div class="divider"></div><div class="flex has-12-gap is-centered"><div class="quote-author-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a6421772d2279d5e388f109_sam.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="" class="cover"/><div class="image-overlay"></div></div><div class="box has-4-gap"><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="regular---16px">Sam Andrew</p><p data-wf--paragraph--variant="small-muted---14px">Portfolio Manger at NIV</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="outline"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-controls"><div class="swiper-navigation"><div data-wf--button--variant="grey" class="button w-variant-d35d331c-04d6-faf4-de2a-c6a1e069f967"><div class="clickable"><a swiper-button="prev" data-no-hover="true" href="#" class="clickable-link w-inline-block"><div class="link-text">Back</div></a></div><div data-icon-direction="left" data-wf--button-element--variant="white" class="button-element"><div class="button-text">Back</div><div class="button-icon"><div class="icon-wrapper"><div class="svg-icon has-effect w-embed"><svg width="0.875em" height="0.875em" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
