</style></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_8319fe73-1458-0dab-b346-e3be69716e3d-4dea52f6" class="slot-2"><div mobile-align-center="" data-max-width="" data-align-content="" data-wf--content--variant="spacing---24px" class="content"><div class="box w-variant-99769a71-6384-d033-cbe1-86f114679d2b"><div class="latest-citations"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="cms-grid w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7490391169512652802/" target="_blank" class="cms-item w-inline-block"><div class="thumbnail"><img width="316" height="246" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e470cc0c098fdafc5d69_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.45.20%402x.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 316px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e470cc0c098fdafc5d69_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.45.20%402x-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e470cc0c098fdafc5d69_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.45.20%402x-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e470cc0c098fdafc5d69_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.45.20%402x-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e470cc0c098fdafc5d69_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.45.20%402x.png 1592w" class="cover"/></div><div class="cms-content"><div class="flex has-8-gap is-centered has-wrap"><div class="small-text">Coinbase</div><div class="separator"></div><div class="small-text muted-50">August 4, 2026</div></div><h3 data-wf--heading--variant="18px---h6" class="heading w-variant-4ff8eb9c-66f3-b0c0-46b0-6edf6c3d262a">Artemis is now in the Coinbase Consensus Estimates</h3><p class="body-text is-muted para-limit">Coinbase and Brian Armstrong reported their Q2&#x27;26 earnings last week and the Analyst Estimates included Artemis... along with top analysts from Bank of America, Barclays, JP Morgan, etc. We partnered up with Amit Haas who won the last Coinbase modeling competition to model out Q2&#x27;26 earnings.</p></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7488629464021524480/" target="_blank" class="cms-item w-inline-block"><div class="thumbnail"><img width="316" height="246" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4913d69d5b043aa75db_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.06%402x.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 316px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4913d69d5b043aa75db_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.06%402x-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4913d69d5b043aa75db_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.06%402x-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4913d69d5b043aa75db_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.06%402x-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4913d69d5b043aa75db_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.06%402x.png 1592w" class="cover"/></div><div class="cms-content"><div class="flex has-8-gap is-centered has-wrap"><div class="small-text">Robinhood</div><div class="separator"></div><div class="small-text muted-50">July 29, 2026</div></div><h3 data-wf--heading--variant="18px---h6" class="heading w-variant-4ff8eb9c-66f3-b0c0-46b0-6edf6c3d262a">Vlad Tenev shouts out Artemis on Robinhood Earnings </h3><p class="body-text is-muted para-limit">Yesterday, Robinhood held their live Q2&#x27;26 earnings at Nasdaq Marketsite with institutional, sell side, retail / independent analyst. As an independent analyst, I asked: &quot;What could go right with Robinhood Chain?&quot; Vlad&#x27;s first line: &quot;I&#x27;ve been enjoying your content and your analysis on X, it&#x27;s really good&quot; Wow. Investing is changing. The days of just sell-side mattering is EVOLVING as buy-side / retail and independent analysts like Artemis matter MORE.
</p></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="https://www.spglobal.com/spdji/en/index-launches/article/sp-dow-jones-indices-and-pantera-capital-launch-new-index-for-digital-assets/" target="_blank" class="cms-item w-inline-block"><div class="thumbnail"><img width="316" height="246" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4b00c4c31404658985d_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.36%402x.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 316px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4b00c4c31404658985d_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.36%402x-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4b00c4c31404658985d_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.36%402x-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4b00c4c31404658985d_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.36%402x-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e4b00c4c31404658985d_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.46.36%402x.png 1594w" class="cover"/></div><div class="cms-content"><div class="flex has-8-gap is-centered has-wrap"><div class="small-text">S&amp;P Global</div><div class="separator"></div><div class="small-text muted-50">July 22, 2026</div></div><h3 data-wf--heading--variant="18px---h6" class="heading w-variant-4ff8eb9c-66f3-b0c0-46b0-6edf6c3d262a">Artemis powers S&amp;P Pantera Fundamental Index</h3><p class="body-text is-muted para-limit">Artemis powers the FIRST ever S&amp;P Pantera Digital Asset Index! It was a huge honor to work with Cosmo Jiang Pantera Capital and the amazing team Sherifa Issifu and Michael Orzano, CFA at S&amp;P Dow Jones Indices to help power THE FIRST ever Fundamental Index for Crypto. The next $10T from institutions will flow towards digital assets with real fundamentals.</p></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="https://x.com/artemis/status/1988714470957334979?s=20" target="_blank" class="cms-item w-inline-block"><div class="thumbnail"><img width="316" height="246" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e59c088b68b5e8d0f8ec_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.50.31%402x.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 316px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e59c088b68b5e8d0f8ec_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.50.31%402x-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a630faad31f9b208f5a7248/6a74e59c088b68b5e8d0f8ec_CleanShot%202026-08-06%20at%2015.50.31%402x.png 782w" class="cover"/></div><div class="cms-content"><div class="flex has-8-gap is-centered has-wrap"><div class="small-text">Circle</div><div class="separator"></div><div class="small-text muted-50">July 3, 2026</div></div><h3 data-wf--heading--variant="18px---h6" class="heading w-variant-4ff8eb9c-66f3-b0c0-46b0-6edf6c3d262a">Artemis Data Cited in Circle&#x27;s Q3 2025 Earnings Call</h3><p class="body-text is-muted para-limit">Artemis payment and stablecoin data was cited on Circles&#x27;s Q3 2025 earnings call. Jeremy Allaire said, “There’s a third-party analyst firm, Artemis, which has recently published, I think, some of the best data on growth in business-to-business payments, international business-to-business payments, and the growth through these periods. I think—I don’t know what the ending period [is]. The ending period is pretty recent—is very strong. I think it’s reflective of what we’re seeing in the partnerships that we’re forming in the cross-border-related payment space.”</p></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--padding-bottom--variant="80px" class="padding-bottom w-variant-688f05fc-3faa-5bd9-5d06-54f3b53e3125"></div><div class="background-box"><div class="background-grid"><div class="grey-box on-left"><div class="white-box"></div><div class="grey-line"></div></div><div class="grey-box"><div class="white-box"><div class="background"></div></div></div><div class="grey-box on-right"><div class="white-box"></div><div class="grey-line is-second"></div></div></div></div></section><section data-wf--section--variant="base" class="section"><div data-wf--padding-top--variant="40px" class="padding-top w-variant-50f09327-27e2-2a4e-7115-8d2db6ae9a5d"></div><div class="container"><div data-aos="fade-in" data-wf--layout--variant="stacked" class="layout"><div class="slot-1"><div mobile-align-center="" data-max-width="754" data-align-content="center" data-wf--content--variant="spacing---24px" class="content"><div class="box w-variant-99769a71-6384-d033-cbe1-86f114679d2b"><h2 data-wf--heading--variant="48px---h2" class="heading w-variant-5699317a-0f5f-cf07-180b-6b2039a0b8fb">15+ Proprietary Datasets </h2></div><div class="w-embed"><style>
  [data-max-width="754"] {max-width: 754px;}
</style></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_8319fe73-1458-0dab-b346-e3be69716e3d-4dea52f6" class="slot-2"><div class="animation"><div class="w-embed w-script"><style>
.afm-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;overflow:hidden}
.afm-stage{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:1120px;height:620px;transform-origin:top left;color:#151515;font-family:'Geist',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;display:grid;grid-template-columns:420px 40px 320px 40px 300px}
.afm-plate{background:#F5F6F8;border-radius:10px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
.afm-plate.src{padding:16px}
.afm-plate.out{padding:14px 12px}
.afm-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.afm-ghead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.afm-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:#649BE2;flex:none}
.afm-gname{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
.afm-rule{flex:1;height:1px;background:#E1E4E9}
.afm-rows{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-auto-flow:column;gap:5px 12px}
.afm-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;padding:2px 5px;margin-left:-5px;border-radius:4px}
.afm-row.is-soon{color:#848A8A}
.afm-row.is-lit{animation:afmSrc 10.8s infinite}
.afm-ico{width:18px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center}
.afm-ico img{height:14px;max-width:18px;width:auto;border-radius:3px;display:block}
.afm-ico img.md{height:15px}
.afm-ico img.lg{height:17px}
.afm-badge{font-style:normal;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:2px;background:#F75218;color:#fff}
.afm-badge.is-soon{background:#F3F4F3;color:#848A8A}
.afm-conn{position:relative}
.afm-conn svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}
.afm-pipe{fill:none;stroke:#BEC4CC;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-dasharray:2 8;stroke-linecap:round;animation:afmDash 1.4s linear infinite}
.afm-mid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.afm-panel{border:1px solid #E5E5E5;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(21,21,21,.05),0 16px 36px rgba(132,138,138,.18);padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.afm-phead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em}
.afm-phead img{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:3px;display:block}
.afm-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#848A8A;margin-bottom:7px}
.afm-q{min-height:74px;border:1px solid #E5E5E5;border-radius:5px;background:#F6F8FC;padding:10px 11px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45}
.afm-q div{white-space:nowrap}
.afm-q .l1{animation:afmT1 10.8s steps(27) infinite}
.afm-q .l2{animation:afmT2 10.8s steps(27) infinite}
.afm-q .l3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px}
.afm-q .l3 span{white-space:nowrap;animation:afmT3 10.8s steps(9) infinite}
.afm-caret{display:inline-block;width:1.5px;height:15px;background:#649BE2;animation:afmBlink .9s step-end infinite,afmCaret 10.8s infinite}
.afm-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}
.afm-step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:14px 1fr;gap:9px;align-items:start;opacity:.25}
.afm-stepdot{width:11px;height:11px;margin-top:3px;border-radius:99px;border:2px solid #C1C1C1;box-sizing:border-box}
.afm-step b{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.afm-step em{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;color:#7A7F87;margin-top:1px;line-height:1.3}
.afm-step:nth-child(1){animation:afmR1 10.8s infinite}.afm-step:nth-child(1) .afm-stepdot{animation:afmD1 10.8s infinite}
.afm-step:nth-child(2){animation:afmR2 10.8s infinite}.afm-step:nth-child(2) .afm-stepdot{animation:afmD2 10.8s infinite}
.afm-step:nth-child(3){animation:afmR3 10.8s infinite}.afm-step:nth-child(3) .afm-stepdot{animation:afmD3 10.8s infinite}
.afm-step:nth-child(4){animation:afmR4 10.8s infinite}.afm-step:nth-child(4) .afm-stepdot{animation:afmD4 10.8s infinite}
.afm-out{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid #E5E5E5;border-radius:5px;padding:8px 10px;background:#fff}
.afm-out.is-landing{animation:afmOut 10.8s infinite}
.afm-otitle{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.afm-osub{font-size:12px;color:#7A7F87;margin-top:1px}
.afm-thumb{width:56px;height:40px;flex:none;border:1px solid #E5E8EF;border-radius:3px;background:#F6F8FC;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden}
.afm-thumb i{display:block}
.afm-thumb .l{height:2px;background:#C9CDD3;margin-bottom:3px}
.afm-thumb .l.ink{height:3px;background:#151515}
.afm-thumb .l.blue{height:3px;background:#649BE2}
.afm-thumb .w45{width:45%}.afm-thumb .w55{width:55%}.afm-thumb .w62{width:62%}.afm-thumb .w70{width:70%}.afm-thumb .w80{width:80%}
.afm-thumb .blk{height:8px;background:#C3D6EF}
.t-doc{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:4px;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box}
.t-doc>div{flex:1}
.t-grid{display:grid;grid-template-rows:repeat(5,1fr);grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);height:100%}
.t-grid i.hd{background:#151515}
.t-grid i.hl{background:#C3D6EF}
.t-tbl{padding:4px;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
.t-tbl .r{display:flex;gap:3px}
.t-tbl .r i{flex:1;height:3px;background:#E1E4E9}
.t-tbl .r i.c1{flex:none;width:30%;background:#9AA0A8}
.t-tbl .r.hd i{height:4px;background:#151515}
.t-tbl .r.out i{background:#C3D6EF}
.t-tbl .r.out i.c1{background:#649BE2}
.t-bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:3px;padding:4px;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box}
.t-bars i{flex:1;background:#C3D6EF}
.t-bars i.hi{background:#649BE2}
.t-kpi{padding:4px;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.t-kpi .tiles{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2px}
.t-kpi .tiles i.a{background:#649BE2}.t-kpi .tiles i.b{background:#C3D6EF}.t-kpi .tiles i.c{background:#E3EAF8}
.t-res{padding:4px;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.t-res .l.ink{height:4px}
.t-res .cols{flex:1;display:flex;gap:4px}
.t-res .cols>div{flex:1}
.t-res .chart{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:2px;padding:1px;border:1px solid #E5E8EF;background:#fff}
.t-res .chart i{flex:1;background:#C3D6EF}
.t-res .chart i.hi{background:#649BE2}
@keyframes afmDash{to{stroke-dashoffset:-18}}
@keyframes afmSrc{0%,6.4%{background:transparent}10%,100%{background:#EEF2FB}}
@keyframes afmBlink{0%,49%{opacity:1}50%,100%{opacity:0}}
@keyframes afmT1{0%,16.7%{clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0)}22.3%,100%{clip-path:inset(0 0 0 0)}}
@keyframes afmT2{0%,22.3%{clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0)}27.9%,100%{clip-path:inset(0 0 0 0)}}
@keyframes afmT3{0%,27.9%{clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0)}33.5%,100%{clip-path:inset(0 0 0 0)}}
@keyframes afmCaret{0%,16.6%{opacity:0}16.7%,33.5%{opacity:1}33.6%,100%{opacity:0}}
